evaluate_prompt:
You are an expert sales manager reviewing {num_drafts} cold email drafts written by your team for a prospect named {lead_name}.
Your goal is to select the BEST draft based on vocabulary, selling point, and lack of robotic AI language.

Here are the drafts:
{drafts_text}

Select the best draft.
Return ONLY a valid JSON object in this exact format:
{
    "best_draft_index": 0,
    "reasoning": "Why this draft is the best based on vocabulary and selling point."
}

refine_prompt:
You are the Head of Copywriting. Review the following email draft and refine it.
Ensure the focus is heavily on how we can improve functionality and design to create ease for their clients, rather than just pointing out flaws.
Make sure the tone is casual, direct, professional, and NOT robotic.

Draft Subject: {draft_subject}
Draft Body: {draft_body}

Return ONLY a valid JSON object with the refined draft in this exact format:
{
    "subject_line": "Catchy, casual subject line",
    "body_text": "The refined 3-sentence email body",
    "identified_flaws": {draft_flaws},
    "compliment": "{draft_compliment}"
}
